OL,3,GNEWSAGrieving family welcome PM's brain
OL,4,Acancer promise
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family whose daughter died from a
OL,7,Fbrain tumour have welcomed Prime
OL,8,FMinister Andy Burnham's promises for
OL,9,Fmore investment into brain cancer
OL,10,Fresearch.
OL,12,FClare and Mark Grimley, from
OL,13,FBournemouth, Dorset, lost their
OL,14,Ffour-year-old daughter Seren to a brain
OL,15,Fcancer, called an ependymoma, a year
OL,16,Fafter she was diagnosed.
OL,18,FSeren had brain surgery, learnt to walk
OL,19,Fagain, went through proton beam therapy
OL,20,F(PBT) and had a "really positive" end
OL,21,Fof treatment scan, before the tumour
OL,22,Fgrew back within months.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
